[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "審査まであと３日。いよいよ大詰めでござる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Three days until the audition. We're in the home stretch."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "再生数、登録者、どっちもいい感じに増えてるわね。\nこの調子なら審査にも受かるんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Views and subscribers are both trending up nicely. At this rate, we might actually pass the audition."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうも言ってられないかも。『ＱＥジーンズ』も着々と\n人気を獲得してるみたいだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wouldn't get too comfortable. Looks like QE Jeans is steadily gaining popularity too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むぐぐ……どこまで行ってもライバルってわけね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grr... so they're rivals no matter where we turn."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、勢いならあなたたちも負けてないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But your momentum is just as strong as theirs."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その通り！\n３日でこいつらを追い抜くわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly! We're overtaking them in three days!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "みんな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
