    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お化けでも見るような顔。みんなどうしたの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Why are you all looking at me like you've seen a ghost?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんであんたがここに！？\nしれっと交じってんじゃないわよ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are YOU doing here?! Don't just blend in like that!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わああ、ごめんなさい！\nダメだよベップ！\u3000勝手に入っちゃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahh, I'm so sorry! Bepp, you can't just barge in like that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不躾な訪問と、ベップの非礼を謝罪。\n申し訳ありません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Apologies for the intrusion, and for Bepp's rudeness. We are sorry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "『ＱＥジーンズ』！？\u3000どうしてここに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "QE Jeans!? What are you doing here?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "改めてご挨拶をさせてください。\nはじめまして！\u3000『ＱＥジーンズ』のキューンです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Allow us to introduce ourselves properly. Nice to meet you! I'm Quinn, from QE Jeans!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ。以後お見知りおきを",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga. Pleased to make your acquaintance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ベップよ。よろしく",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I'm Bepp. Good to meet you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このたびは、皆さんにコラボ動画企画のお誘いに\n参りました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We came to propose a collaboration video with all of you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コラボ動画……『ＱＥジーンズ』のみんなと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A collab video... with QE Jeans?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000ここ最近皆さんが出されている動画を見て、\nぜひやってみたいなって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! We've been watching your recent videos, and we'd really love to try something together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そちらのプロダクションに連絡をしたところ、\n直接本人たちと交渉せよと、ララ社長が",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When we contacted your production company, President Lara told us to negotiate directly with you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……ちなみに、どのような内容を\n検討していますでしょう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... and what sort of content did you have in mind?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "互いに１本ずつ企画を持ち寄ってコラボ動画を\n収録するというものよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Each side brings one idea, and we record a collaboration video together."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん、その後はそれぞれのアカウントで\n企画したほうの動画を投稿するわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Naturally, afterward each account posts the video they came up with."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、妥当な内容でありまする。\n少し相談しますゆえ、お待ちくだされ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That seems fair enough. Give us a moment to discuss it, if you don't mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさかこんなことになるなんて……\nねえどうする、鬼門？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't believe this is happening... What do we do, Kimon?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "審査までにもう一手欲しいと思っていたのは事実。\nここはリスクを承知で誘いを受けるべきでありまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We were looking for one more move before the audition. The risk is real, but we should accept."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと、何か裏があるんじゃないの？\nライバルを潰しに来たとか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on—what if there's an angle here? Like they're trying to take us out as rivals?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふーむ。それはないと思うでござるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. I don't think that's the case."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ？\u3000なんでそんなことが言えるわけ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What? How can you be so sure?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは……まあ良いではありませんか。\n何を仕掛けられたとしても、勝てば良いだけのこと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... never mind that. Whatever they throw at us, all we have to do is win."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それともヨハナは、自信がないでござるか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Unless you're not feeling confident?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ、そんなわけないでしょ。望むところよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha! As if. Bring it on."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、答えは決まりでござるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then the answer is settled."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お待たせいたした、『ＱＥジーンズ』の皆様方",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry to keep you waiting, QE Jeans."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "拙者たち『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』は\nそのお誘いを受けまする！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We, Cutie☆AnimaL, accept your offer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]